+line	declaration	attributes	coverage_or_role	assessment
+7	parseLoopBody : Stmts	function	one unconditional equation	Defined but manually copied; no total attribute or opacity.
+23	parseFunctionBody : Stmts	function	one unconditional equation	Defined but manually copied; no total attribute or opacity.
